OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F362A1787080720
OL,3,CHow 'groundbreaking' drones are
OL,4,Ccombatting trespassing on railway
OL,6,FA pioneering fleet of automated drones
OL,7,Fdeployed across Britain's rail network
OL,8,Fhas been hailed a major success by
OL,9,FBritish Transport Police (BTP).
OL,11,FFirst introduced in May 2025, the
OL,12,F"drone in a box" system places the
OL,13,Fsmall aircraft inside weatherproof
OL,14,Fpods positioned alongside key railway
OL,15,Ftracks.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/7
