FL,363,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36202
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F362A1787080720
OL,3,CHow 'groundbreaking' drones are
OL,4,Ccombatting trespassing on railway
OL,6,FWhen an emergency occurs - such as
OL,7,Ftrespassers on the track or a train
OL,8,Fderailment - the pod opens and the
OL,9,Fdrone launches automatically to
OL,10,Fprovide live intelligence to control
OL,11,Frooms.
OL,13,FFollowing a pilot it has now been
OL,14,Frolled out in Manchester - one of the
OL,15,Fcountry's hotspots for trespassers.
OL,17,F"This is about reducing trespass and
OL,18,Fdisruption," Simon Batchelor, Head of
OL,19,FDrones Program at British Transport
OL,20,FPolice said.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/7
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,363,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36203
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F362A1787080720
OL,3,CHow 'groundbreaking' drones are
OL,4,Ccombatting trespassing on railway
OL,6,F"By deploying drones at key locations,
OL,7,Fwe're able to respond to incidents in
OL,8,Fseconds rather than having officers
OL,9,Ftravel, sometimes for up to an hour,
OL,10,Fto remote or hard-to-reach areas.
OL,12,F"This not only saves time, but also
OL,13,Freduces the risks for officers and
OL,14,Frailway staff who would otherwise need
OL,15,Fto physically search dangerous
OL,16,Fenvironments."
OL,26,@xD@NO]
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/7
