OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,363,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36204
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F362A1787080720
OL,3,CHow 'groundbreaking' drones are
OL,4,Ccombatting trespassing on railway
OL,6,FThe force is the first in the UK to
OL,7,Froutinely fly drones beyond the
OL,8,Fstandard Visual Line of Sight (VLOS),
OL,9,Fwhich restricts pilots to a distance
OL,10,Fof around 500 metres.
OL,12,FInstead, pilots, stationed at control
OL,13,Fhubs in cities such as London,
OL,14,FManchester, and Leeds, can fly the
OL,15,Faircraft remotely across huge
OL,16,Fstretches of the network once it is
OL,17,Ffully deployed across the country.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G4/7
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,363,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36205
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F362A1787080720
OL,3,CHow 'groundbreaking' drones are
OL,4,Ccombatting trespassing on railway
OL,6,FThe drones are equipped with 4K
OL,7,Fcameras and advanced thermal imaging,
OL,8,Fallowing them to operate day or night
OL,9,Fand accurately locate trespassers
OL,10,Fincluding vulnerable individuals,
OL,11,Fchildren, or those in mental health
OL,12,Fcrisis.
OL,14,F"It's about getting the right resource
OL,15,Fto the right place quickly," Simon
OL,16,Fadded.
OL,18,F"We know a lot of disruption is caused
OL,19,Fby people who need help, so this
OL,20,Ftechnology helps us respond faster and
OL,21,Fmore appropriately."
OL,26,@vD@AOUzD@AOU}D@TO]
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G5/7
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
