OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,363,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36206
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F362A1787080720
OL,3,CHow 'groundbreaking' drones are
OL,4,Ccombatting trespassing on railway
OL,6,FCurrently, there are seven sites
OL,7,Facross the UK using the drone in a box
OL,8,Fsystem, with two boxes at each
OL,9,Flocation, including new deployments in
OL,10,FManchester, Leeds, and Leicester.
OL,12,FBritish Transport Police says it plans
OL,13,Fto expand this capability further
OL,14,Facross the rail network.
OL,16,F"The drones are fantastic. They show
OL,17,Fwe're embracing technology and data to
OL,18,Fminimise disruption and enable a fast
OL,19,Fresponse," BTP Chief Constable Lucy
OL,20,FD'Orsi, said.
OL,26,@xD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G6/7
