OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,363,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36207
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F362A1787080720
OL,3,CHow 'groundbreaking' drones are
OL,4,Ccombatting trespassing on railway
OL,6,F"Since April, we've been averaging
OL,7,Fincident response times of just three
OL,8,Fminutes twenty-eight seconds
OL,9,Fsignificantly faster than sending
OL,10,Fofficers by car."
OL,12,FShe added: "Trespassing is a criminal
OL,13,Foffence. It carries a fine of up to
OL,14,F#1,000 and can result in a criminal
OL,15,Frecord. But more importantly, it's
OL,16,Fabout safety. We want to make trespass
OL,17,Fsocially unacceptable for everyone's
OL,18,Fsake."
OL,26,@rD@QO]tD@LOUzD@FO]
